// A two-hand blade on the Greatblade class: slower, harder, wider than the blade's, and hard to stagger mid swing.
// Its edge line scales the damage of its cuts (the signature): a bought one,
// at 500, cuts at 0.95 of the class's figure, as a bought carbine fires
// slower than the table. Its chassis in `crates/veyra-weapons` gives it mounts
// and its baked picture and model (ticket 0010, step 3): head and grip open, power opens at 600, so a bought one (500) has two of its three.
// Sold at Pelagic's board, and made by its schematic.
(
    id: "veyra:weapon.yard_greatblade",
    name: "Yard greatblade",
    maker: "Pelagic Works",
    kind: Weapon(
        family: "Greatblade",
        chassis: "heavy_cutter",
        mounts: [
            (slot: "head"),
            (slot: "grip"),
            (slot: "power", opens_at: Some(600)),
        ],
        signature: Some((line: "edge", property: HitDamage, worst: 0.80, best: 1.10)),
    ),
    stack: 1,
    price: Some(260),
    lines: [
        (id: "edge", name: "Edge"),
        (id: "durability", name: "Durability"),
        (id: "moddability", name: "Moddability"),
    ],
    icon: (shape: Rod, color: "#A9B1BA", picture: Some("heavy_cutter/whole.png"), symbol: Some("veyra:icon.weapon.heavy-tool")),
)
